===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gem-pro|ang}} {{m|gem-pro|*beraną}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|ang}} {{m|ine-pro|*bʰer-}}.
Cognate with {{etyl|osx|-}} {{m|osx|beran}}, {{etyl|goh|-}} {{m|goh|beran}}, {{etyl|non|-}} {{m|non|bera}}, {{etyl|got|-}} {{m|got|𐌱𐌰𐌹𐍂𐌰𐌽}}.  The Indo-European root was also the source of {{etyl|sga|-}} {{m|sga|biru}}, {{etyl|grc|-}} {{m|grc|φέρω}}, {{etyl|la|-}} {{m|la|ferre}}.

===Pronunciation===
